abstract: "A multi-room isolated heterogeneous AI audit system for honest auditing and controlled truth promotion of formal reasoning artifacts (Lean proofs, mathematical reasoning chains). Core innovations: physical isolation with orthogonal observation dimensions (formal/numerical/semantic/adversarial); three-level truth hierarchy (EMPIRICAL/THEOREM-COND/THEOREM); permanent hard-wall marking (GAP-OPEN); active abandonment capability (CANCELLED with revival conditions). Theoretical basis: P19 exogenous potential phase transition theorem and C-02 same-system multi-agent invalid audit corollary."
